# Recorded input for the search field page (widgets/search.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 100 in the
# default theme: the box at x 12..308, y 38..63, its Clear button at its right end (shown
# while there is text). One line per frame below (format: input.Replay). Scancodes: Enter 40,
# Escape 41.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 100
dt 0.016
pointer 300 95
# 1: press the field: focused
frame
pointer 100 50
buttons left
# 2: release, type and Enter: a search
frame
buttons
text widgets
press 40
# 3: Escape clears
frame
press 41
# 4: type again; the pointer over the Clear button
frame
text lanes
pointer 275 50
# 5: press Clear: the field loses focus while it is held
frame
buttons left
# 6: release over it: cleared, and the field focused again
frame
buttons
# 7: the pointer leaves
frame
pointer 300 95
# 8: typing goes on in the field
frame
text zig
